Depends-on: #770, #771

## Context

Box: `ec2-user@3.217.199.168`, AL2023 2023.12. Container runtime is provisioned (leaf/768-runtime), playwright image is pinned and deployed to box (leaf/768-image-pin), integrator is verified/patched (leaf/768-integrator-patch). Sentinel `~/cbnet/run/visual_gate_soft` is still in place. This leaf runs the live pixel-diff gate: green on current bundle, red on a CSS mutation. Only after both pass does the sentinel-off leaf proceed.

**Source path:** `~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app` — kept fresh by `deploy-runtime.sh` lines 101–103 (git clone/pull); contains `package.json` + `scripts/`. Do NOT use `~/cbnet/www` — that is the built vite dist (`index.html` + `assets/`) with no source tree.

**viteMode note:** `visual-regression.mjs` lines 185–187 branch on `hasDistIndex`: if `dist/index.html` exists in the mounted volume → `viteMode="preview"` (serves prebuilt assets); if absent → `viteMode="dev"` (source live-rendered). `deploy-runtime.sh` L104–105 runs `npm run build` and copies `dist/` to `~/cbnet/www` but does NOT delete `dist/` from `~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app`, so dist/ is present on the box. Production integrator always mounts a dist/-free git checkout (dist/ is gitignored); GHA CI also checks out without dist/ — both always run in `dev` mode.

## Task

**Step 1 — run green check:**

Using `<chosen-runtime>` (podman or docker, per leaf/768-runtime's RUNTIME-CHOICE comment) and `<pinned-digest>` (from `~/cbnet/playwright-image.digest` on box):

```
<chosen-runtime> run --rm \
  -v ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app:/app:rw \
  -w /app \
  <pinned-digest> \
  bash -c "PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_BROWSER_DOWNLOAD=1 npm install --no-audit --no-fund --silent && node scripts/visual-regression.mjs"
```

Expect EXIT 0.

**Step 2 — baseline reshoot (if baselines mismatch, EXIT 1 on green run):**

Jammy container image ≠ ubuntu-GHA rendering; threshold is 100px. If the green run exits 1 due to baseline mismatch, reshoot in `viteMode="dev"` to match production integrator and GHA CI:

```
# a. Remove dist/ so viteMode=dev (matches production + CI; without this step
#    dist/index.html is present → viteMode=preview → preview-mode baselines diverge
#    from dev-mode production rendering → persistent false CI failures)
rm -rf ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/dist

# b. Reshoot baselines
<chosen-runtime> run --rm \
  -v ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app:/app:rw \
  -w /app \
  <pinned-digest> \
  bash -c "PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_BROWSER_DOWNLOAD=1 npm install --no-audit --no-fund --silent && node scripts/visual-regression.mjs --update-baselines"

# c. Copy new PNGs to ui/app/scripts/baselines/, commit through PR
# d. sha-lock regen (MANDATORY in same PR): update sha256 entries for all three
#    canonical PNG rows in reference/runtime-manifest.tsv:
#      ui/app/scripts/baselines/board.png
#      ui/app/scripts/baselines/team.png
#      ui/app/scripts/baselines/human.png
#    runtime-manifest.test.sh Test 3 sha256sum-checks every canonical row;
#    committing new PNGs without updating manifest fails CI Test 3.

# e. Restore dist/ on box
cd ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app && npm run build
```

**Step 3 — verify EXIT 0 on current bundle (dist/ now restored; green gate).**

**Step 4 — red-gate mutation (must target compiled output, not source CSS):**

Background: dist/ is present when the container mounts the volume → `viteMode="preview"` → vite serves prebuilt assets from `dist/assets/`; mutating source CSS has zero effect on screenshots → false-pass.

Primary approach (compiled CSS, explicit backup/restore):
```
# a. Backup
cp -r ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/dist/assets ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/dist/assets.bak

# b. Mutate compiled CSS (vite preview serves these files)
sed -i "s/background[^;]*;/background: red !important;/" ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/dist/assets/*.css

# c. Rerun container (same volume mount) → verify EXIT 1
<chosen-runtime> run --rm \
  -v ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app:/app:rw \
  -w /app \
  <pinned-digest> \
  bash -c "PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_BROWSER_DOWNLOAD=1 npm install --no-audit --no-fund --silent && node scripts/visual-regression.mjs"
# Expect EXIT 1

# d. Restore (do NOT use git checkout dist/assets/ — dist/ is gitignored, never tracked)
rm -rf ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/dist/assets && mv ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/dist/assets.bak ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/dist/assets
```

Alternative (dev-mode path):
```
# a. Remove dist so viteMode=dev
rm -rf ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/dist
# b. Mutate source CSS (IS git-tracked)
sed -i "s/background[^;]*;/background: red !important;/" ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app/src/App.css
# c. Rerun container → verify EXIT 1
# d. Revert source
git -C ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app checkout src/
# e. Restore dist
cd ~/cbnet-uibuild/ui/app && npm run build
```

**Step 5 — both EXIT 0 (green) AND EXIT 1 (red) confirmed → signal leaf/768-sentinel-off by posting a comment: "VALIDATE-PASS: green EXIT 0 confirmed; red EXIT 1 confirmed; baseline mode=dev".**

